<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0">
    <title>Company &amp; About Us — Orain Labs</title>
    <meta name="description" content="About Orain Labs: Building the intelligence layer for engineering with geometric reasoning, CAD kernel execution, and AI-native design systems.">

    <!-- Premium Typography: Instrument Sans for UI, JetBrains Mono for Technical Data -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        /* =====================================================================
           1. CORE SYSTEM & VARIABLES (DARK MODE DEFAULT)
           ===================================================================== */
        :root {
            --bg-base: #0a0a0a;
            --bg-base-rgb: 10, 10, 10;
            --bg-soft: #141414;
            --bg-surface: #1e1e1e;

            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #a0a0a0;
            --text-muted: #666666;

            --line: #2a2a2a;
            --line-light: #1a1a1a;

            --font-sans: 'Instrument Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            --nav-height: 80px;
            --subnav-height: 52px;
        }

        body.light-mode {
            --bg-base: #ffffff;
            --bg-base-rgb: 255, 255, 255;
            --bg-soft: #fcfcfc;
            --bg-surface: #f5f5f4;

            --text-primary: #000000;
            --text-secondary: #555555;
            --text-muted: #888888;

            --line: #e5e5e5;
            --line-light: #f0f0f0;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            font-size: 16px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--bg-base);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.5;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: opacity 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
        }

        /* =====================================================================
           2. TYPOGRAPHY & SHARED UTILITIES
           ===================================================================== */
        .container {
            width: min(1320px, calc(100% - 4rem));
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
        }

        .label-sm {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
        }

        .headline-xl {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.8rem);
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .headline-md {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .headline-sm {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .body-lg {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.3vw, 1.2rem);
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1.65;
            max-width: 760px;
        }

        .body-md {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .link-cta {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding-bottom: 3px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--text-primary);
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: none;
            border-top: none;
            border-left: none;
            border-right: none;
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
        }

        .link-cta:hover {
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        .reveal {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(16px);
            transition: opacity 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        .reveal.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* =====================================================================
           3. PRIMARY NAVIGATION & COMPANY SUB-NAV
           ===================================================================== */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: var(--nav-height);
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(var(--bg-base-rgb), 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .nav-container {
            display: flex;
            height: 100%;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2.2rem;
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .nav-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .theme-toggle-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .theme-toggle-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--line-light);
        }

        /* Sticky Company Sub-Navigation */
        .subnav-bar {
            position: sticky;
            top: var(--nav-height);
            width: 100%;
            height: var(--subnav-height);
            z-index: 90;
            background: rgba(var(--bg-base-rgb), 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-light);
        }

        .subnav-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 2rem;
            height: 100%;
            overflow-x: auto;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
        .subnav-container::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

        .subnav-link {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            white-space: nowrap;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0.4rem 0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .subnav-link:hover {
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .subnav-link.active {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border-bottom-color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        /* =====================================================================
           4. TAB PANEL SWITCHING SYSTEM
           ===================================================================== */
        .tab-panel {
            display: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(8px);
            transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s ease;
        }

        .tab-panel.active {
            display: block;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
            animation: panelFadeIn 0.35s ease forwards;
        }

        @keyframes panelFadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(8px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .company-hero {
            padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 2.5rem);
            padding-bottom: 6rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-light);
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, var(--bg-soft) 0%, var(--bg-base) 70%);
        }

        .section-block {
            padding: 6rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-light);
        }

        .tab-panel > .section-block:first-child:not(.company-hero) {
            padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 2.5rem);
        }

        /* =====================================================================
           5. SECTION & CARD COMPONENTS
           ===================================================================== */
        .mission-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }

        .statement-card {
            background: var(--bg-soft);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .quote-lead {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .engine-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3.5rem;
        }

        .engine-card {
            background: var(--bg-soft);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 2.8rem 2.2rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            min-height: 320px;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .engine-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--text-muted);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .engine-tag {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .engine-footer-tag {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line-light);
            padding-top: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .pipeline-strip {
            margin-top: 4rem;
            background: var(--bg-soft);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 2.2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.2rem;
        }

        .pipeline-step {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .pipeline-arrow {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
        }

        .philosophy-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3.5rem;
        }

        .philosophy-card {
            border-left: 2px solid var(--line);
            padding: 1rem 0 1rem 1.8rem;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .philosophy-card:hover {
            border-left-color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        /* Careers Specific Cards */
        .careers-container {
            margin-top: 3.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .career-card {
            background: var(--bg-soft);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 2.2rem 2.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .career-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--text-muted);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .career-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* =====================================================================
           6. FOOTER
           ===================================================================== */
        footer {
            padding: 6rem 0 3rem;
            background: var(--bg-base);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .footer-brand + p {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            max-width: 220px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .footer-email {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-weight: 500;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            padding-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .footer-col {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .footer-col a {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 0.2rem 0;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .footer-col a:hover {
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line-light);
            padding-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        /* Responsive Breakpoints */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .mission-grid, .engine-grid, .philosophy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .career-card { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1.5rem; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container { width: calc(100% - 2.5rem); }
            .pipeline-strip { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.8rem; }
            .statement-card { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Primary Navigation -->
    <header id="navbar">
        <div class="container nav-container">
            <a href="index.html" class="logo">ORAIN LABS</a>
            <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary navigation">
                <a href="index#product">Build with Orain</a>
                <a href="business">Business</a>
                <a href="company" class="active">Company</a>
                <a href="research">Research</a>
            </nav>
            <div class="nav-actions">
                <a href="careers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="nav-cta" style="font-size: 0.85rem;">Careers &nearr;</a>
                <button id="theme-toggle" class="theme-toggle-btn" aria-label="Toggle Theme">
                    <svg id="theme-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle>
                        <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
                        <line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                        <line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"></line>
                        <line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"></line>
                        <line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line>
                        <line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"></line>
                        <line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"></line>
                        <line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"></line>
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Sub-Navigation for Company Sections -->
    <nav class="subnav-bar" aria-label="Company subsections">
        <div class="container subnav-container">
            <a href="#about" class="subnav-link active">About Us</a>
            <a href="#architecture" class="subnav-link">Core Architecture</a>
            <a href="#philosophy" class="subnav-link">Vision &amp; Philosophy</a>
            <a href="#careers" class="subnav-link">Careers</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main id="company-tab-root">
        <!-- =============================================================
             1. TAB: ABOUT US
             ============================================================= -->
        <div id="about" class="tab-panel active">
            <!-- Hero -->
            <section class="company-hero">
                <div class="container">
                    <span class="label-sm">ABOUT ORAIN LABS</span>
                    <h1 class="headline-xl">Building the Intelligence Layer for Engineering</h1>
                    <p class="body-lg">
                        Orain Labs is a deep-technology company building the next generation of engineering intelligence.
                    </p>
                    <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                        <a href="#architecture" class="link-cta link-tab">Explore the System Architecture &rarr;</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Mission & Core Tenets -->
            <section class="section-block reveal">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="mission-grid">
                        <div>
                            <span class="label-sm">FOUNDATION &amp; PURPOSE</span>
                            <h2 class="headline-md">Beyond Text: Reasoning About Physical Geometry</h2>
                            <p class="body-lg" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
                                We believe the future of engineering will not be defined by AI that simply understands text, but by systems that can reason about geometry, engineering constraints, physical relationships, and design intent. Our work is focused on building that foundation.
                            </p>
                            <p class="body-lg" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
                                At the center of our research is <strong>ORAIN — The Geometric Intelligence</strong>: an AI-native engineering system designed to understand what engineers mean, reason about how a design should work, and translate that reasoning into precise, engineering-grade geometry.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="statement-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="label-sm" style="color: var(--text-primary);">CORE PREMISE</span>
                                <p class="quote-lead">
                                    "Engineering knowledge, reasoning, and geometry must exist within the same computational loop."
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                                <a href="#philosophy" class="link-cta link-tab">Read our engineering philosophy &rarr;</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- =============================================================
             2. TAB: CORE ARCHITECTURE & ENGINES
             ============================================================= -->
        <div id="architecture" class="tab-panel">
            <section class="section-block reveal">
                <div class="container">
                    <span class="label-sm">SPECIALIZED INTELLIGENCE LAYERS</span>
                    <h2 class="headline-md">ORAIN System Architecture</h2>
                    <p class="body-lg">
                        ORAIN is built on a set of specialized technologies working together as one unified system rather than a collection of disconnected plugins.
                    </p>

                    <div class="engine-grid">
                        <!-- Module 1: ERE -->
                        <div class="engine-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="engine-tag">REASONING LAYER // 01</span>
                                <h3 class="headline-sm">Engineering Reasoning Engine (ERE)</h3>
                                <p class="body-md">
                                    Forms the reasoning layer of ORAIN. It evaluates design intent, engineering constraints, relationships, feasibility, and consistency before geometry is constructed. Rather than treating geometry generation as a simple shape-generation problem, ERE enables ORAIN to reason about why a geometry should exist and whether the proposed design makes engineering sense.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="engine-footer-tag">ERE KERNEL &bull; CONSTRAINT VALIDATION</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Module 2: Geometric Engine -->
                        <div class="engine-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="engine-tag">PLANNING LAYER // 02</span>
                                <h3 class="headline-sm">Geometric Engine</h3>
                                <p class="body-md">
                                    Translates engineering intent and reasoning into structured geometric representations. It acts as the bridge between intelligence and geometry — planning features, relationships, dimensions, constraints, and operations that can ultimately be executed by a CAD kernel. This is where engineering reasoning begins to become actual geometry.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="engine-footer-tag">PARAMETRIC PLANNING &bull; GRAPH TRANSLATION</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Module 3: ORAIN Forge -->
                        <div class="engine-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="engine-tag">CONSTRUCTION LAYER // 03</span>
                                <h3 class="headline-sm">ORAIN Forge</h3>
                                <p class="body-md">
                                    The geometry construction and execution layer. Built around robust CAD-kernel technology, Forge takes structured geometric instructions and produces precise, topology-aware CAD geometry. It is responsible for executing operations, maintaining geometric integrity, and generating engineering-compatible representations and formats. Forge is not the product itself — it is one of the core foundations that enables ORAIN to construct reliable engineering geometry.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="engine-footer-tag">CAD KERNEL &bull; TOPOLOGY-AWARE B-REP</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Module 4: VSE -->
                        <div class="engine-card">
                            <div>
                                <span class="engine-tag">VISUALIZATION LAYER // 04</span>
                                <h3 class="headline-sm">Visualization Sub-Engine (VSE)</h3>
                                <p class="body-md">
                                    Provides the visual representation layer of ORAIN. It enables engineers to see, inspect, and interact with the geometry and design states produced throughout the system. VSE focuses on visualization and interaction — ensuring that complex geometric information can be represented clearly without becoming part of the underlying reasoning or geometry-generation process.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="engine-footer-tag">DECOUPLED RENDERING &bull; INTERACTIVE INSPECTION</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Flow Pipeline -->
                    <div class="pipeline-strip">
                        <div class="pipeline-step"><span>01</span> Engineering Intent</div>
                        <span class="pipeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                        <div class="pipeline-step"><span>02</span> Reasoning</div>
                        <span class="pipeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                        <div class="pipeline-step"><span>03</span> Geometric Planning</div>
                        <span class="pipeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                        <div class="pipeline-step"><span>04</span> Geometry Construction</div>
                        <span class="pipeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                        <div class="pipeline-step"><span>05</span> Visualization</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- =============================================================
             3. TAB: VISION & PHILOSOPHY
             ============================================================= -->
        <div id="philosophy" class="tab-panel">
            <section class="section-block reveal">
                <div class="container">
                    <span class="label-sm">OUR APPROACH</span>
                    <h2 class="headline-md">One System. Multiple Intelligence Layers.</h2>
                    <p class="body-lg">
                        Our goal is not to build another CAD interface with an AI assistant attached to it. We are building a fundamentally different engineering system.
                    </p>

                    <div class="philosophy-grid">
                        <div class="philosophy-card">
                            <h3 class="headline-sm">Integrated Computational Loop</h3>
                            <p class="body-md">
                                Where engineering knowledge, spatial reasoning, and B-Rep geometry construction exist within the same unified computational feedback loop.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="philosophy-card">
                            <h3 class="headline-sm">Communicating at Intent Level</h3>
